# Build context for the images built from the repository root (backend/Dockerfile and
# frontend/Dockerfile). The Python service builds from its own directory and has its own
# python-services/document-processing/.dockerignore.
#
# Dependencies are installed inside the image from pnpm-lock.yaml and every output is rebuilt there,
# so nothing installed or generated on the host is sent.

# Version control, editors, agent tooling
.git
.gitignore
**/.DS_Store
.vscode
.idea
.claude
.agents
CLAUDE.md
skills-lock.json

# Secrets: environment files never enter an image. Containers receive configuration at run time.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example

# Installed dependencies and build output (rebuilt in the image)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-ssr
**/.dev
**/.dev-*
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.tanstack
frontend/src/app/router/routeTree.gen.ts

# Tests, coverage and browser-test output
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/blob-report
**/.vitest

# Logs and caches
**/*.log
**/.cache
**/.eslintcache

# Python (not part of these images)
python-services
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/*.egg-info

# Not needed to build or run any image
docs
supabase
infrastructure/deployment
**/README.md
